SPOILER!!!(VERY USEFUL SPOILER)!!!!!!!!!!




Well, this most useful of bugs (which will be going away) is simple.
1)  drop everything you can and pick up all the junk you can (armor, etc)
2)  place it all in the uncursed bag of holding
3)  pick up and put in it as much as you can.
4)  dip the bag in the unholy water (will curse it)
5)  take everything out  (be warned, some of the things will disappear)
6)  dip it in holy water, the bag is now uncursed and weighs a negative
amount.
7)  as you do this again and again, the weight decrease speeds up, in about 3
tries you should be in the -1000%'s.  Remember, below -1000% you cannot hit
anything, but around -5000% your kicking ability is a whopper...

